			<Comment>SWANで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-19T05:50:30" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="BC_STR_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たいせんの　せいかを　たたえて
バトルポイントを　しんてい　いたします▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nagihashi_toru:W00268"
				Time="2011-11-08T13:31:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-11-08T09:52:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>対戦の　成果を　称えて
バトルポイントを　進呈いたします▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-19T05:51:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
